{"id": "1673-143397-0019", "text": "THE PAST HE REGRETTED HE WAS DISCONTENTED WITH THE PRESENT AND THE FUTURE HE HAD REASON TO DREAD THE ORIENTAL BISHOPS SUCCESSIVELY DISENGAGED THEIR CAUSE FROM HIS UNPOPULAR NAME AND EACH DAY DECREASED THE NUMBER OF THE SCHISMATICS WHO REVERED NESTORIUS AS THE CONFESSOR OF THE FAITH", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1673/143397/1673-143397-0019.flac", "audio_sha256": "d24ff2cf91f1a992101841c4f3e96d9904072fd933b3716ce0d8f81a4c245720", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "1673", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 251120, "duration": 15.695}
{"id": "174-50561-0003", "text": "THE WANDERING SINGER APPROACHES THEM WITH HIS LUTE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/174/50561/174-50561-0003.flac", "audio_sha256": "e9297505e740f8196d4903ef38414bfbf8082f06a31af4474ad6446a44992faa", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "174", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 53440, "duration": 3.34}
{"id": "174-84280-0015", "text": "SHE WAS DESTROYED NOT MERELY BY THE UNCONSIDERED UNDISCIPLINED PASSIONS OF HER HUSBAND AND HER LOVER BUT BY THE VAST TRADITION THAT SUSTAINS AND ENFORCES THE SUBJUGATION OF HER SEX", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/174/84280/174-84280-0015.flac", "audio_sha256": "9c044050d125298d54a7186f9771608ad2dc43b5e9605ec8fd6024b0cbb17680", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "174", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 219680, "duration": 13.73}
{"id": "1919-142785-0051", "text": "PUT THE UDDER INTO A STEWPAN WITH SUFFICIENT WATER TO COVER IT LET IT STEW GENTLY TILL QUITE DONE WHEN TAKE IT OUT TO COOL", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1919/142785/1919-142785-0051.flac", "audio_sha256": "1177aa322fd968741c5279d7ac436c875272cba3ae6720b1a5c375e9400341ea", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "1919", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 148640, "duration": 9.29}
{"id": "2035-147960-0004", "text": "IT WAS ON ONE OF THESE GRAVEL BEDS THAT I MET MY ADVENTURE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/147960/2035-147960-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "7a0d780be28f78c1dfc79d24537e9119cea4359a4c4258e0ed47e37529926f7b", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 66720, "duration": 4.17}
{"id": "2035-147961-0008", "text": "IT SEEMED TO ME THAT HE DESPISED HIM FOR BEING SO SIMPLE AND DOCILE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/147961/2035-147961-0008.flac", "audio_sha256": "f64db01ded0348fda0972cc32622386e0d2d7ccd889ac2a496597d4d7617fd32", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 68000, "duration": 4.25}
{"id": "2035-152373-0013", "text": "WHILE THE LIBERATED EXILES REJOICED ON THE PLAIN OF MEATH THE TENT OF THE ABBOT OF IONA WAS PITCHED ON THE RATH OF TARA A FACT WHICH WOULD SEEM TO INDICATE THAT ALREADY IN LITTLE MORE THAN A CENTURY SINCE THE INTERDICT HAD FALLEN ON IT THE EDIFICES WHICH MADE SO FINE A SHOW IN THE DAYS OF PATRICK WERE RUINED AND UNINHABITABLE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/152373/2035-152373-0013.flac", "audio_sha256": "aaa615b41c4e11cf552e2d39cdb06ae733bae2c53cb6ce5fa27a07e9fabb8bb7", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 327520, "duration": 20.47}
{"id": "2412-153954-0006", "text": "THEIR EXPRESSION WAS DIVINE AND AS THEY GLANCED AT ME TIMIDLY BUT WITH PARTED LIPS IN GREAT BEWILDERMENT I FORGOT ALL THOUGHTS OF THEIR CONVERSION IN FEELINGS THAT WERE FAR MORE EARTHLY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2412/153954/2412-153954-0006.flac", "audio_sha256": "3feac5890500534685cde5eca5835e47d06bb2b7d0923b2ae3a544f2d68e30d1", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2412", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 163520, "duration": 10.22}
{"id": "2428-83705-0001", "text": "BUT IT IS QUITE PLAIN TO ME THAT ALL THE ARRANGEMENTS FOR MY WEDDING ARE GOING TO BE MADE BY THE SNELLINGS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2428/83705/2428-83705-0001.flac", "audio_sha256": "a7cfd2d49bd00d7ade17541a2abf885e295ba9155efcf9e800d65afab9a8c5ca", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2428", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 109520, "duration": 6.845}
{"id": "251-136532-0018", "text": "WITHOUT QUESTION HE HAD BECOME OVERNIGHT THE MOST WIDELY KNOWN ARCHAEOLOGIST IN HISTORY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/251/136532/251-136532-0018.flac", "audio_sha256": "ef7975b40540016f4bad0ba5f01638e2313041ba1994d3efb8ad4a7441324b60", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "251", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 110000, "duration": 6.875}
{"id": "251-137823-0000", "text": "I'LL BE GLAD TO TRY SIR HE REPLIED", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/251/137823/251-137823-0000.flac", "audio_sha256": "0d414255c68f617ca56f32d1c3521e6c22686ed92e99559bb903da5aea5be602", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "251", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 54960, "duration": 3.435}
{"id": "2803-161169-0008", "text": "HERE IS SOMETHING DIFFERENT ROUNDED LIKE A NUT SHELL YOU CAN SPLIT OFF ONE SIDE AND BEHOLD THERE IS THE NUT LYING SNUGLY AS DOES ANY CHESTNUT IN ITS BUR", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2803/161169/2803-161169-0008.flac", "audio_sha256": "a8e6541fe83e19d096cf298811bbd5778c2e7c3c86a2e57efa2374611c829af7", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "2803", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 226240, "duration": 14.14}
{"id": "3000-15664-0027", "text": "THEIR LONG MASSIVE EARS GIVE THEM A VERY STRIKING APPEARANCE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3000/15664/3000-15664-0027.flac", "audio_sha256": "fc9ee6da5425f794b2e5bf5de50b7c7574ffa9d31917f74a0f7a8cee14c9de8f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3000", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 64720, "duration": 4.045}
{"id": "3081-166546-0048", "text": "WELL WELL THAT'S HONEST AT ALL EVENTS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3081/166546/3081-166546-0048.flac", "audio_sha256": "30595865552fd32665056354e4e002fc9472e78c9ebbe65d377b14168fe39eee", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3081", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 76960, "duration": 4.81}
{"id": "3752-4944-0015", "text": "WELL NOW SAID MEEKIN WITH ASPERITY I DON'T AGREE WITH YOU", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3752/4944/3752-4944-0015.flac", "audio_sha256": "c1b8b0adadf569873ccb5d6c9717fdb5a5849bfcd7c4e5b87db9404fbf2d47f1", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "3752", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 66160, "duration": 4.135}
{"id": "6295-64301-0009", "text": "HE WAS IN A MOOD FOR MUSIC WAS HE NOT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6295/64301/6295-64301-0009.flac", "audio_sha256": "d0393a23285fe4063666362685c384bfcdb56bfd83ecc5eeb1270268ca634d34", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6295", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 48080, "duration": 3.005}
{"id": "6345-93302-0004", "text": "AND CURIOUSLY ENOUGH SHE WAS HARDLY CURIOUS AT ALL ABOUT WHAT HE MIGHT HAVE TO SAY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6345/93302/6345-93302-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "6286249d34ba7dd1da463bacbe2b1f4f6490750b093abc19276680352dfb9676", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6345", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 70640, "duration": 4.415}
{"id": "6345-93302-0028", "text": "HE CHECKED THE SILLY IMPULSE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6345/93302/6345-93302-0028.flac", "audio_sha256": "743d713400a50573dae930e5accc5da524d56e9fb48d1fc4771d3eafe6a933bb", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "6345", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 31040, "duration": 1.94}
{"id": "777-126732-0040", "text": "THEY ARE NOURISHING THEIR GREED ON THE QUIVERING FLESH AND THE WARM BLOOD OF THE PEOPLE NOTHING ELSE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0040.flac", "audio_sha256": "b18c3bedc9c4f06919959d896de9fbf719934f2339cd010c06b336dc7d592a88", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 79760, "duration": 4.985}
{"id": "777-126732-0064", "text": "THAT POOR BOY IS IN A VERY EXCITED STATE TO NIGHT SHE MURMURED AFTER A PAUSE WHICH LASTED FOR THREE TICKS OF THE CLOCK", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0064.flac", "audio_sha256": "001aff4f8622c8a7ada9a4b573bd710ff7ecab6970ba789025561921a7fd8481", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 93759, "duration": 5.8599375}
{"id": "7976-110124-0013", "text": "THE TWO ELDEST ATE THEIR APPLES BUT THE YOUNGEST COULD NOT EAT THAT NIGHT SHE THREW THE APPLE AWAY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/7976/110124/7976-110124-0013.flac", "audio_sha256": "c2dc16808b08d915de18156e2cc69db3596bf4f8a3156a740582f206bc53139a", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "7976", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 104880, "duration": 6.555}
{"id": "8297-275154-0019", "text": "I TRIED IT YESTERDAY IT SET MY BRAINS ON FIRE I'M FEELING THAT GLASS I TOOK JUST NOW", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8297/275154/8297-275154-0019.flac", "audio_sha256": "6557ca40c916bcc774a5219f9d9f7465b43c0497adaf63e9548b3e0b5c2bb27d", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "8297", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 126080, "duration": 7.88}
{"id": "84-121123-0023", "text": "NOIRTIER WAS NEAR THE BED PALE MOTIONLESS AND SILENT AS THE CORPSE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/84/121123/84-121123-0023.flac", "audio_sha256": "de5ac89fdba6009de9ca8b9cacd6e8d3604c35985d412deb7dc7bb61dc0872c0", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "84", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 74960, "duration": 4.685}
{"id": "8842-302196-0004", "text": "POETRY NOT BEING AN EXACT SCIENCE LITERALITY OF RENDERING IS ALTOGETHER SECONDARY TO THIS CHIEF LAW", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8842/302196/8842-302196-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "2ce3543f12ba2033a869fbce7434e74f149722db31ed5e494cad6d1bf9462ae4", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "pilot", "language": "en", "speaker": "8842", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 91840, "duration": 5.74}
